{'symbol': 'NLSN', 'date': '2022-02-07 09:05:00', 'title': 'NIELSEN LAUNCHES DIVERSE MEDIA EQUITY PROGRAM', 'text': 'NEW YORK, FEB. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NIELSEN ANNOUNCES THE LAUNCH OF ITS DIVERSE MEDIA EQUITY PROGRAM, WHICH IS DESIGNED TO ELEVATE THE VISIBILITY OF DIVERSE-OWNED MEDIA COMPANIES WITH ADVERTISERS AND AGENCIES. THE COMPREHENSIVE INITIATIVE INCLUDES MEASUREMENT OF DIVERSE-OWNED MEDIA HISTORICALLY EXCLUDED FROM INVESTMENT, FUNDING CERTIFICATION FEES OF DIVERSE-OWNED MEDIA, AS WELL AS THE LAUNCH OF THE FIRST EVER REPORT ON DIVERSE-OWNED MEDIA REACH AND AUDIENCE PROFILES.'}